      "explanation": "To determine the option in which the hybridisation of the underlined atom is affected, we need to look at each reaction and predict the changes in hybridisation that might be occuring with the reactants and products.\n\n<p>Option A:</p>\n<p>In the reaction <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.742ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15.953ex\" height=\"2.337ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -705 7051.3 1033\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"munder\"><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D44B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D44B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(852,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D452\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D452\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(0,-476)\"><svg width=\"1318\" height=\"177\" x=\"0\" y=\"178\" viewBox=\"329.5 178 1318 177\"><use data-c=\"2013\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2013\" transform=\"scale(3.954,1)\"></use></svg></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(1318,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D439\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D439\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(676,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"34\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-34\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(2619.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(3620,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D446\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D446\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(4265,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D44F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D44F\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(4694,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D439\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D439\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(676,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"35\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-35\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(6051.3,0)\"><use data-c=\"2192\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2192\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>, xenon tetrafluoride (XeF<sub>4</sub>) reacts with antimony pentafluoride (SbF<sub>5</sub>). XeF<sub>4</sub> is a square planar molecule, and the central Xe atom is <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.439ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"5.471ex\" height=\"2.326ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -833.9 2418.3 1027.9\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D460\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D460\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msup\" transform=\"translate(469,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D45D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(536,363) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"msup\" transform=\"translate(1408.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D451\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D451\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(606.2,363) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> hybridised. The reaction with SbF<sub>5</sub> can lead to the formation of a complex where the hybridisation of Xe changes if it coordinates with SbF<sub>5</sub>. Thus, the hybridisation of Xe may indeed be affected in this case.</p>\n\n<table class=\"tg\">\n<thead>\n  <tr>\n    <th class=\"tg-baqh\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.742ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"2.982ex\" height=\"2.287ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -683 1318 1011\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"munder\"><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D44B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D44B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(852,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D452\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D452\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(0,-476)\"><svg width=\"1318\" height=\"177\" x=\"0\" y=\"178\" viewBox=\"329.5 178 1318 177\"><use data-c=\"2013\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2013\" transform=\"scale(3.954,1)\"></use></svg></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>F<sub>4</sub></th>\n    <th class=\"tg-baqh\">+</th>\n    <th class=\"tg-baqh\">SbF<sub>5</sub></th>\n    <th class=\"tg-baqh\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.025ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"2.262ex\" height=\"1.181ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -511 1000 522\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2192\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2192\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></th>\n    <th class=\"tg-baqh\">[XeF<sub>3</sub>]<sup>+</sup>[SbF<sub>6</sub>]<sup>-</sup></th>\n  </tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"tg-baqh\">sp<sup>3</sup>d<sup>2</sup></td>\n    <td class=\"tg-baqh\"></td>\n    <td class=\"tg-baqh\"></td>\n    <td class=\"tg-baqh\"></td>\n    <td class=\"tg-baqh\">sp<sup>3</sup>d   sp<sup>3</sup>d<sup>2</sup></td>\n  </tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n\n\n<p>Option B:</p>\n<p>In the reaction <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.767ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/s